    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 365 of the laws of 2011, relating to authorizing the village of Southampton, in the county of Suffolk, to offer certain retirement options to police officer Theodore Raffel, Jr., in relation to specifying the time frame under which the village of Southampton shall pay the costs for implementing such retirement options",
